/**
 * Reframed from a methodology argument into a cost one.
 *
 * This explained that ranking by absence and ranking by demand disagree, with
 * processor landing third by absence and last by demand. That is the correct
 * reason our ranking differs and it is not a merchant's problem: nobody
 * outside this building cares which ranking function we use.
 *
 * Same evidence, stated as the thing it costs. One plan touches twice as many
 * products and helps almost nobody.
 */
